--switch-ignition-1 enabled: ignition randomized each episode in a 100x100 cell box around the scenario's original ignition.
PPO rollout config: num_envs=36, n_steps=144, effective_batch=5184, minibatches=12, batch_size=432
Decision start delay: Palisades copy.json response_time / 60 = 60.0 minutes
Allowed tactic combinations: 17
Diagnostic: gc.collect() and prior-sim drop at reset start enabled.
Vector env start method: fork
Policy arch: default (independent pi=[512,256,128] / vf=[512,256,128], Tanh)
Using cpu device
PPO hyperparams: lr=0.0005 (decay^0.6), n_epochs=7, gamma=0.99, target_kl=0.02
